[I] PowerPC specific utilities

[T] This set of utilities allow the control of several PowerPC specific
[T] hardware such as the the nvram.

[U] https://github.com/ibm-power-utilities/powerpc-utils

[A] International Business Machines
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] base/system
[R] + powerpc powerpc64
[F] CROSS

[L] GPL
[V] 1.4

[D] 97847b461ea1f8913c8f4794e2cac906cfe16e6351ed3ac39ea8d95c powerpc-utils-1.4.tar.gz https://github.com/ibm-power-utilities/powerpc-utils/archive/refs/tags/v1.4/

autogen=1
[ $prefix_auto = 1 ] && prefix= && set_confopt
var_append CC_WRAPPER_APPEND ' ' -std=gnu17
pkginstalled librtas || var_append confopt ' ' --without-librtas
